{%- comment -%}
  Zo Veilig — Liever zelf samenstellen (2026-11-02). A copy of sections/camera-hardware.liquid's
  Winkelgrid (hero, trust strip, filter chips, 3-column grid, the visitor's set, callback band, FAQ)
  for hardware picked one by one, linked from the "Liever zelf samenstellen" pill on Oplossingen.
  Same conversion as the camera page: by phone or callback only, never self-checkout (nothing here
  touches the cart, so the Overzicht/av_akkoord rule in CLAUDE.md has no new entry point). The
  callback POSTs a lead to window.ZV_LEAD_ENDPOINT (Odoo CRM), lead_type kept as 'camerahardware'.

  Product data is the HW array below, not Shopify products (hardware has no images or tags and
  most Koop products aren't published to the Online Store). Rows are the camera page's own rows,
  verbatim, for the sensor, camera, doorbell and remote categories; `kh`/`hh` are the Koop and Huur
  product handles, `sku`/`huurSku` the SKUs, all read from Shopify (Admin API, 2026-11-02), none
  used by the grid itself. Prices are literals like on the camera page; the one that differed from
  the live product (Afstandsbediening Huren, H0010) is the live EUR 0,80. Not here, deliberately:
  no hub/panel product exists in Shopify, the Ontzorgpakket is a per-package add-on (a different
  product per package) and the Woning lines belong to a package line, so the cart
  guard would remove it. See docs/zelf-samenstellen-2026-11-02.md.

  Matcher (sections/zelf-samenstellen-matcher.liquid, above this section): each row has a slug `m`
  (rendered as data-match); the matcher's `zv-match:apply` event marks the recommended rows (.zv-match-hit
  + "Aanbevolen · Nx" badge), dims the rest and fills the hidden #ccDescription of the callback form, which
  the lead sends as `description`. See docs/zelf-samenstellen-matcher-2026-11-02.md.

  Filter chips (data-filter) match a row's `cat`; a chip that matches no row is hidden.
  Trust strip: one `trust` block per item (template JSON), a label plus an optional zv-route
  key for the page that backs it.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="zv-zelf">
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="crumb">
        <a href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'oplossingen' %}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Oplossingen</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span><b>Liever zelf samenstellen</b>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="ch-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: 'Zelf samenstellen' | escape }}</span>
      <h1>{{ section.settings.title | default: "Stel uw eigen beveiliging samen" | escape }}</h1>
      <p>{{ section.settings.lead | default: "Kies per onderdeel wat u wilt: sensoren, camera's, een videodeurbel of een afstandsbediening. Kopen of huren, u bepaalt het per product." | escape }}</p>
      <div class="ch-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn--gold" href="#winkel">{{ section.settings.cta_shop | default: "Bekijk alle onderdelen" | escape }}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M6 13l6 6 6-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'contact' %}">{{ section.settings.cta_advice | default: 'Vraag advies aan' | escape }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="ch-trust">
      <ul class="wrap">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            {%- if block.settings.route != blank -%}
              <a href="{% render 'zv-route', key: block.settings.route %}">{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</a>
            {%- else -%}
              <span>{{ block.settings.label | escape }}</span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <section class="wrap ch-shop" id="winkel" aria-labelledby="ch-shop-h">
    <div class="cat-head">
      <h2 id="ch-shop-h">Kies uw onderdelen</h2>
      <span class="cat-hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01M10.3 3.9 2.4 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h15.8a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Kies per product kopen of huren</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ch-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter op categorie">
      <button type="button" class="ch-chip on" data-filter="" aria-pressed="true">Alle <span class="n"></span></button>
      <button type="button" class="ch-chip" data-filter="sensoren" aria-pressed="false">Sensoren <span class="n"></span></button>
      <button type="button" class="ch-chip" data-filter="camera" aria-pressed="false">Camera's <span class="n"></span></button>
      <button type="button" class="ch-chip" data-filter="deurbel" aria-pressed="false">Videodeurbel <span class="n"></span></button>
      <button type="button" class="ch-chip" data-filter="bediening" aria-pressed="false">Bediening <span class="n"></span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="zv-match-note" id="zvMatchNote" role="status" tabindex="-1" hidden>
      <span id="zvMatchNoteT"></span>
      <button type="button" id="zvMatchClear">Toon alles</button>
    </div>
    <div class="rows" id="rows"></div>
  </section>

  <div class="ch-bar" id="chBar" hidden>
    <div class="ch-bar-in">
      <span class="ch-bar-t" id="chBarT"></span>
      <a href="#uw-setup">Bekijk uw setup</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="wrap ch-setup" id="uw-setup" aria-labelledby="ch-setup-h">
    <div class="summary">
      <h2 id="ch-setup-h">Uw set</h2>
      <div class="sum-cams">
        <span class="ci"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8.5h4l1.5-2.5h7L17 8.5h4v11H3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="3.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></span>
        <div><b id="camCount">0</b><span>onderdelen gekozen</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="sum-list" id="sumList"></div>
      <div class="sum-empty" id="sumEmpty">Nog niets toegevoegd. Kies per product kopen of huren.</div>
      <div class="sum-tot" id="sumTot"></div>
      <button class="sumbtn" id="sumBtn" disabled>Bel om te bestellen<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button>
      <div class="sum-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Bestellen gaat altijd via een kort telefoongesprek, 088 122 11 11</div>
    </div>
    <form class="cam-contact" id="camContact" data-consent-error="{% render 'zv-form-copy', key: 'consent_error' %}">
      <div class="cam-contact-h">Of laat ons u terugbellen</div>
      <input type="hidden" id="ccDescription" name="description">
      <input type="text" id="ccName" placeholder="Naam" required>
      <input type="tel" id="ccPhone" placeholder="{% render 'zv-form-copy', key: 'phone_placeholder' %}" aria-label="Telefoonnummer" required>
      <input type="email" id="ccEmail" placeholder="E-mailadres (optioneel)">
      <label class="cam-contact-consent">
        <input type="checkbox" id="ccConsent" required>
        <span>{% render 'zv-form-copy', key: 'consent' %}</span>
      </label>
      <div class="cam-contact-err" id="ccErr"></div>
      <button type="submit">Verstuur terugbelverzoek</button>
      <div class="cam-contact-done" id="ccDone"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.5 12.5l5 5 10-11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Dank voor je interesse, we nemen snel contact met u op.</div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="ch-cta" aria-labelledby="ch-cta-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="ch-cta-in">
        <div>
          <h2 id="ch-cta-h">Niet gevonden wat u zocht?</h2>
          <p>Staat het product dat u zoekt er niet bij, of weet u niet zeker welke onderdelen bij uw woning passen? Onze adviseurs kijken vrijblijvend met u mee en stellen samen met u de juiste set samen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ch-cta-actions">
          <a class="btn btn--gold" href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'contact' %}">Plan een adviesgesprek</a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="tel:0881221111">Bel 088 122 11 11</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap ch-faq" aria-labelledby="ch-faq-h">
    <h2 id="ch-faq-h">Veelgestelde vragen over zelf samenstellen</h2>
    <div class="fq-item"><button class="fq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ch-fqa-1">Wat is het verschil tussen kopen en huren?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="fq-a" id="ch-fqa-1" role="region"><div class="fq-a-in">Kiest u kopen, dan betaalt u één keer. Kiest u huren, dan betaalt u een vast bedrag per maand via SEPA-incasso. Huren kan bij de meeste producten; een enkel product is alleen te koop. U kiest het per product.</div></div></div>
    <div class="fq-item"><button class="fq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ch-fqa-2">Hoe bestel ik mijn set?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="fq-a" id="ch-fqa-2" role="region"><div class="fq-a-in">Bestellen gaat altijd via een kort telefoongesprek. Stel op deze pagina uw set samen en bel <a href="tel:0881221111">088 122 11 11</a>, of laat uw naam en telefoonnummer achter, dan bellen wij u terug.</div></div></div>
    <div class="fq-item"><button class="fq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ch-fqa-3">Wat heb ik nodig om een camera te gebruiken?<span class="pm" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></button><div class="fq-a" id="ch-fqa-3" role="region"><div class="fq-a-in">Voor onze camera's is een cloudopslag-abonnement vereist. Daarnaast heeft u een stabiele internetverbinding nodig met een uploadsnelheid van minimaal 2,0 Mbps per camera, en voldoende wifi-signaal op de plek waar de camera komt.</div></div></div>
    <p class="ch-faq-more">Meer vragen? <a href="{% render 'zv-route', key: 'faq' %}">Bekijk alle veelgestelde vragen</a></p>
  </section>
</div>

